# What this tool writes is personal data: the page carries your VIN, order id, delivery address and
# shipment tracking numbers, and the `--json` dump carries all of that plus the delivery address and
# the order email. Committed by accident, they are in a git history forever.
#
# Defaults the tool itself writes (rivian_order_view.html, and whatever you pass to --json), plus
# the names this project's own docs and test suite use, so a copy-pasted command cannot leave a
# personal page staged.
rivian_order_view*.html
rivian_order_view*.json
report.html
report.json
out.html
out.json

# The synthetic pages and payloads under samples/ are tracked on purpose — they are the fixture.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
